@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+# migrate_to_npu
+
+NPU (Ascend) specific deployment & configuration assets for Protenix.
+Business logic lives in `protenix/`; everything here is setup-time only.
+
+```
+migrate_to_npu/
+├── env_npu.sh                 # one-shot NPU env (CANN / toggles)
+├── requirements_npu.txt       # NPU dependencies (torch/torch_npu + common deps)
+├── docs/
+│   └── npu_installation.md    # install & runtime notes
+└── test/
+    ├── inference_demo.sh      # NPU inference demo
+    └── train_demo.sh          # NPU training demo
+```
+
+Quick start:
+
+
+```bash
+source migrate_to_npu/env_npu.sh          # set CANN / data path
+pip install -r migrate_to_npu/requirements_npu.txt
+bash migrate_to_npu/test/inference_demo.sh
+bash migrate_to_npu/test/train_demo.sh
+```
